          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the passage of a bright disk moving at a fast and constant speed, without any noise. Likely atmospheric reentry of a meteoroid.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "2871b15212db40fd552ae9b39afc62c2b88525321047415eda90d2c597358ba2"
        },
        {
          "end_ms": null,
